      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LENNY LIMES (2) has a strong overall record having eight wins and 12 places from 23 starts including a last start second (23.05) over 400m at Mt Gambier. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. STARLIGHT RIOT (5) has an excellent record here having never missed the placings in 24 starts, including 13 wins and 11 placings. In the money last time at this track (19.85) in a Special conditions race, finishing a 1.75 lengths third. Can hit the frame with the right run. MAKE SOME NOISE (1) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish a nose away in second (17.04) at Murray Bridge in a Grade 5 over 300m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from seven starts. Winning chance. GRAND CHIEF (8) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
